{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>My father</b> — Some say it is like אבה, meaning \"my will.\" And what seems right to me: that he says אבי to the Place [i.e., God], and the vocative sign is missing — if Job is tested forever, in truth he will be tested, because his answers are like those of men of iniquity."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :register {:flags {0 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:31.905168268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}